{'symbol': 'FRT', 'date': '2023-04-10 17:30:00', 'title': 'FEDERAL REALTY INVESTMENT TRUST ANNOUNCES PRICING OF GREEN BONDS', 'text': 'NORTH BETHESDA, MD. , APRIL 10, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FEDERAL REALTY INVESTMENT TRUST\xa0(NYSE: FRT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS OPERATING PARTNERSHIP, FEDERAL REALTY OP LP (THE "OPERATING PARTNERSHIP"), HAS PRICED ITS PUBLIC OFFERING OF\xa0$350 MILLION\xa0AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 5.375% NOTES DUE 2028 (THE "GREEN BONDS") AT AN EFFECTIVE YIELD OF 5.468%, MATURING\xa0MAY 1, 2028.'}